setPlan: horizontal sections cut at drawings.set.planCut (400 through the base run,
1700 through the wall run), measured on the room's walls so 4420 x 3200 lands on 1:20,
the room fabric with the door leaf and arc, section marks A and B drawn under the
units, every cut unit's number, chains of every cut member per wall with the wall
ends, the depth chain.
